#: KfiCmModule.cpp:140
msgid ""
"<h1>Font Installer</h1>"
"<p> This module allows you to install TrueType, Type1, Speedo, and Bitmap "
"fonts. If you have StarOffice installed on your system, this can also be "
"configured.</p>"
"<p>This module has 2 main modes of operation:"
"<ul>"
"<li><i>Basic:</i> The underlying folder structure is hidden, and you will "
"only be able to install/uninstall TrueType and Type1 "
"fonts.</li>"
"<li><i>Advanced:</i> This is for more experienced users, and displays the X "
"fonts folder structure - allowing you to add/delete whole folders to/from "
"the X font path. Using this mode you can also install/uninstall Speedo and "
"Bitmap (pcf, bdf, and snf) fonts.</li></ol>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Instalador de Tipografías</h1>"
"<p>"
"Este módulo permite instalar fontes TrueType, Type1, Speedo e Bitmap. Se "
"ten instalado StarOffice, tamén éste pode ser configurado.</p>"
"<p>Este módulo ten dous modos principais de operar:\n"
"<ul"
"<li><i>Básico:</i> A estructura de cartafois ocúltase e só se poden "
"instalar/desinstalar fontes TrueType e Type1.</li>"
"<li><i>Avantaxado:</i> Este modo é para usuarios con máis experiencia e "
"amosa a estructura de cartafoles das fontes X permitindo engadir/borrar "
"cartafoles dende/para a ruta de fontes X. Empregando este modo pódense "
"instalar/desinstalar ademáis fontes Speedo e Bitmap (pcf, bdf e "
"snf).</li></ol>"

#: KfiCmModule.cpp:151
msgid ""
"<p><b>NOTE:</b> As you are not logged in as \"root\", any fonts installed "
"will only be available to you. To install fonts system wide, use the "
"\"Administrator Mode\" button to run this module as \"root\".</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>NOTA:</b>"
" Como vostede non está identificado coma \"root\", as fontes que se "
"instalen só estarán dispoñibles para vostede. Para instalar fontes a "
"nivel do sistema, empregue o botón \"Modo Administrador\" para executar "
"este módulo coma \"root\".</p>"

