#~ msgid ""
#~ "<B>NOTE</B>\n"
#~ "<p>As you are not logged in as \"root\":\n"
#~ "<ol>\n"
#~ "<li>The settings set here will refer to your own personal settings - any "
#~ "fonts installed by you will (normally) only be available to you. To "
#~ "install fonts system-wide, login as \"root\".</li>\n"
